it_sha":"dc9fc1cb46f069c77f2ade8e077356b2dafdd691","position":"1794629081382484001-2949aa68-bb52-4fc3-a44c-b0ccf4c8b02c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Release commit bc8d46141ad1 pushed as Gerrit change 3401 (hashtag rebar-session-3d705fec). Local `make verify` passed on that tree (2026-11-13 16:57–17:51 PST): 21295 default-tier and 218 integration tests passed, 0 failed. `python -m build` + `twine check` passed for the 0.16.0 wheel and sdist. Plan-review advisory (stale `[Unreleased]` compare link) addressed: it now reads v0.16.0...HEAD. Awaiting LLM-Review and Verified.","timestamp":1794621181379035192},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Change 3401 patchset 1 got Verified -1 (CI run 43543141368): the pip-audit dependency-advisory gate reported CVE-2026-126360 (unrated, treated HIGH) in opentelemetry-api 1.45.1, fix 1.45.2. Per docs/dependency-advisory-runbook.md §1 the finding belongs to this change because it edits uv.lock (the version bump). `uv lock --upgrade-package opentelemetry-api` alone was a no-op because opentelemetry-sdk pins the API exactly, so the whole OTel family (10 packages) moved together to 1.45.2 / 0.66b2. `scripts/dependency_audit.py gate --lane gerrit` on the new lock: \"pip-audit: OK (no known vulnerabilities)\". Re-running make verify before the patchset 2 push. uv.lock is not part of the wheel, so the published package is unaffected.","timestamp":1794622774861929278},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"0.16.0 released 2026-11-13 (PST).\n\n- Version bump: Gerrit change 3401, patch set 2 (b4e0d01b6491cd280fd46841082b63bd8e3d3f4a): LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, 0 unresolved; submitted with scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py --revision at 19:43 PST; merged on main as b4e0d01b6491 (parent d6ba771aabac). Patch set 1 got Verified -1 from the dependency-advisory gate (CVE-2026-126360, opentelemetry-api 1.45.1). Patch set 2 locks the OTel family at 1.45.2 / 0.66b2, and its pip-audit job passed. make verify on the patch set 2 tree (18:19–19:12 PST): 21295 default-tier + 218 integration passed, 0 failed. build + twine check passed.\n- release.yml run 43553173583 (dispatched 19:44 PST from main @ b4e0d01b6491): all 10 jobs succeeded: Authorize (dispatch-from-main, version-lockstep, ancestry, env preflight), Build, Test wheel, Test sdist, Publish to PyPI, Create GitHub Release, Publish to MCP Registry, evidence jobs. The pypi deployment was approved through the pending_deployments REST call (environment 16423961866).\n- PyPI: https://pypi.org/pypi/nava-rebar/json info.version = 0.16.0.\n- GitHub: releases/latest = v0.16.0 (https://github.com/navapbc/rebar/releases/tag/v0.16.0), tag at b4e0d01b6491, assets nava_rebar-0.16.0-py3-none-any.whl, nava_rebar-0.16.0.tar.gz, SHA256SUMS.\n- MCP Registry: servers?search=io.github.navapbc/rebar lists 0.16.0 with isLatest true.\n- Homebrew: navapbc/homebrew-rebar autobump run 43553838714 succeeded; Formula/rebar.rb url = .../nava_rebar-0.16.0.tar.gz, and its sha256 70297eac…5324 matches the PyPI sdist.","timestamp":1794628421578539701}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1794617056119492441,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"4d77f8be-81b1-485e-a12d-f85bcd75d150","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"7c92-014c-fcc2-4f6d"},{"link_uuid":"ac4e4454-02a3-4c1c-9b20-ab288df731d0","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8562-4a0c-22fd-40af"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nPyPI serves 0.15.1. Main since v0.15.1 (48 commits) carries the implemented `agentic` plan-review engine (ADR 0123): `rebar review-plan --engine`, an optional `engine` parameter on the MCP `review_plan` and `review_plan_start` tools, an optional `engine` field on `plan_review_status` and on agentic plan-review attestations, and `[verify] plan_review_engine` as a permanent setting. It also carries several store, Bedrock and CLI fixes. The operator asked for a minor release of that work, cut per `docs/releasing.md`.\n\nVersion: **0.16.0**. The engine work adds user-visible features and agent-visible contract fields, so a minor bump is the matching SemVer step under `docs/api-stability.md` (0.x minors may carry new surface). The release candidate is origin/main `d6ba771aabac`, hand-checked on 2026-11-13 (7 functional checks and a wheel smoke test passed). The known `rebar --version` gap is tracked separately as `coltish-serious-kestrel` and is not part of this release.\n\n## Approach\n\nFollow `docs/releasing.md` §\"Release procedure\" steps 1–5:\n1. In a fresh worktree at origin/main: bump `pyproject.toml` `version`, and `server.json` top-level `version` and every `packages[].version`, to 0.16.0; `uv lock`; write `## [0.16.0] - 2026-11-13` in `CHANGELOG.md` with hand-curated Added/Fixed entries reconciled against `git log v0.15.1..HEAD`, a fresh empty `## [Unreleased]` above it, and the `[0.16.0]` compare-link footer; add a `docs/release-notes.md` section for the 0.16.0 engine contract changes; `make install` then `python scripts/gen_api_surface.py --update` (only `__version__` changes in `tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json`).\n2. `make verify`, then `python -m build && python -m twine check dist/*`; one commit with a `rebar-ticket:` trailer and `-s`; push to Gerrit with the session hashtag; Submit with `scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py <n> --revision <sha>` at LLM-Review +1, Verified +1 and 0 unresolved comments.\n3. `gh workflow run release.yml --ref main -f version=0.16.0`.\n4. Approve the pending `pypi` deployment via `POST repos/navapbc/rebar/actions/runs/$RUN/pending_deployments` with a JSON `--input` body (`environment_ids` integer array).\n5. Confirm every channel; trigger `gh workflow run autobump.yml --repo navapbc/homebrew-rebar` if the tap has not bumped.\n\n## Scope\n\n`pyproject.toml`, `server.json`, `uv.lock`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/release-notes.md`, `tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json`. No `src/rebar` change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] Version bump commit landed on main through Gerrit (change number and merge SHA recorded in a comment); `make verify` passed locally before push; `release_guards.py version-lockstep` passes in the run's `authorize` job.\n- [x] [non-codebase] `release.yml` run for 0.16.0 completes successfully (run id recorded).\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Actions navapbc/rebar; principal=release identity (gh CLI, RebarBotNava-operated session); privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view of the real workflow run\n- [x] [non-codebase] PyPI: `curl -s https://pypi.org/pypi/nava-rebar/json` reports `info.version` 0.16.0.\n  provenance: environment=PyPI production (pypi.org); principal=anonymous public read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — curl of the public JSON API that installers use\n- [x] [non-codebase] GitHub Release: `gh release view v0.16.0 --repo navapbc/rebar` exists, marked Latest, with wheel and sdist attached.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub navapbc/rebar releases; principal=anonymous-equivalent gh API read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh api repos/navapbc/rebar/releases/latest\n- [x] [non-codebase] MCP Registry: `curl -s \"https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io/v0/servers?search=io.github.navapbc/rebar\"` lists version 0.16.0.\n  provenance: environment=registry.modelcontextprotocol.io production; principal=anonymous public read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — curl of the public v0 servers endpoint\n- [x] [non-codebase] Homebrew: `Formula/rebar.rb` in `navapbc/homebrew-rebar` points at the 0.16.0 sdist (`gh api repos/navapbc/homebrew-rebar/contents/Formula/rebar.rb`).\n  provenance: environment=GitHub navapbc/homebrew-rebar main; principal=gh API read; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh api contents/Formula/rebar.rb plus the autobump run","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"pyproject.toml","reason":"version bump to 0.16.0"},{"path":"server.json","reason":"version bump (top-level + packages[])"},{"path":"uv.lock","reason":"root package version"},{"path":"tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json","reason":"__version__ in API surface baseline"},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","reason":"0.16.0 section"},{"path":"docs/release-notes.md","reason":"0.16.0 engine contract changes"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","7c92-014c-fcc2-4f6d"],["relates_to","8562-4a0c-22fd-40af"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"06afd129-bf6f-4f71-bdee-639afb8961a2","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["release"],"ticket_id":"22bb-f4e4-eed3-41ae","ticket_type":"task","title":"Release 0.16.0","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["82cb1e30-d631-4820-bb17-c8880c7768b7","652d2381-7962-42c0-b6f4-efb63ff35244","44bb95c7-e98f-4543-b618-b3c38124ab37","5a9741fc-4d09-45b7-86cb-69e6931eca35","dfc5ef36-a720-40d6-9541-f6dbe847a7ca","8971a1f7-faf5-47c5-a499-978d5341dc00","4d77f8be-81b1-485e-a12d-f85bcd75d150","0047dc26-ecf3-478e-88a5-17ae7cef88ad","ac4e4454-02a3-4c1c-9b20-ab288df731d0","72faa8d0-4f12-4719-9416-16405a1e4da8","b3f78ae3-6dd5-4ffa-8eec-39c3ce64bcde","b4